# Which documents ship — decided 2026-08-11 (CONCERNS R13).
#
# ROADMAP.md, MCP_WORKSTREAM.md and AGENT_OPS_CONSOLE_MASTER_BUILD_SPEC.md were
# removed from this list ON PURPOSE. They quote the SOW, but without them a
# clone cannot resume development — a colleague needs the build plan and the
# workstream status to pick the work up at all. Do not re-add them.
#
# CLAUDE.md likewise ships, redacted (no key status, no auth/CORS detail, no
# local paths).
#
# These two stay out: CONCERNS.md is the unresolved-risk register, and the demo
# script carries verbal framing that is not for the client.
CONCERNS.md
DEMO_TOOLS_MCP.md


